Adapted from HKUDS/DeepTutor commit 6cf793bd868ba5ecbe64722936d4be8fab5a01df, deeptutor/reading/_grounding.py. Modified for Chinese PDF whitespace, Unicode compatibility characters and all-match ambiguity handling. Upstream root has no NOTICE at this commit.

Q2 local retrieval also adapts deeptutor/services/rag/pipelines/llamaindex/config.py,
retrievers.py and rerank.py from the same commit into knowledge/local_rag/.
Changes: project-owned configuration, Chinese BM25 tokenization with canonical
source-node restoration, project FastEmbed/FlagEmbedding rerank adapters,
device-specific model caching, strict score validation and explicit degradation
status. Source and adapted file hashes are recorded in knowledge/local_rag/UPSTREAM.json.
The upstream Apache-2.0 LICENSE is retained in this directory. The local adapters,
tests and evaluator do not start or route requests to the DeepTutor application.

Q2 course navigation extracts the SyllabusUnit dataclass (including its covered
semantics) from deeptutor/services/courses.py at the same commit into
knowledge/local_rag/syllabus.py. The host project binds these ordered units to
published textbook headings and existing task receipts. Learning/mastery policy
and the upstream application service are not copied by this checkpoint.
The source symbol and source/target hashes are recorded in local_rag/UPSTREAM.json.

Q5 first batch adapts the module/objective, learner-profile, progress and
path-binding concepts from deeptutor/learning/models.py and the
explained/understood/next-position semantics from deeptutor/learning/policy.py
and deeptutor/learning/service.py at the same commit into project-owned
agents/q5_learning.py and database/q5_learning.py. The tool surface follows the
mastery_status/build/note_explained/mode/paths/switch/leave/revise semantics
from deeptutor/capabilities/mastery/tools.py, mounted through the project's Q3
protocol and Q4 authorized registry. ``mastery_understood`` is a project-specific
first-batch adapter for teaching-position advancement; it does not grant mastery.
It does not copy the upstream account,
session, LearningStore JSON, path service, question grading, mastery gate,
spaced review, teacher review or application container. Source hashes and the
implemented boundary are recorded in
project/docs/research/2026-10-19-deeptutor-conversation-flow/Q5_IMPLEMENTATION_LOG.md.

The 2026-10-27 native integration additionally adapts the lease and session-binding
SQL from deeptutor/learning/storage.py and the preference update semantics from
deeptutor/services/session/sqlite_store.py and capabilities/mastery/binding.py
at commit 6cf793bd868ba5ecbe64722936d4be8fab5a01df (Apache-2.0).
integrations/deeptutor/learning_binding_adapter.py uses the original tables but
coordinates a host-managed handoff in one attached SQLite transaction. It adds
