SpacedRepetitionScheduler.replay/build_review_queue from the fixed upstream
deeptutor/learning/scheduler.py, together with native LearningService and SQLite
transactions. Review episodes, user deferral, persistent-card host authorization,
HTTP projection and vanilla-JS rendering are local adaptations. No second
scheduler, learning database or AgentLoop was introduced. Verified source hashes
and acceptance boundaries are recorded in NATIVE_FULL_SOURCE_NOTICE.json and
TA4_COMPLETION_20261029.md; production cutover remains disabled.
